      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Most of these are coming off poor runs, unlike FURY (3) who is racing in great heart and is the one to beat. Eight-length winner here last time at the mile and can go back-to-back. ROCK REVOLUTION (4) was runner-up two back then woeful last time here behind Rematch. Best form stacks up nicely and deserves another chance. HETTINGER (1) led and faded when beaten 10 lengths in the same race. Another who is way better than that and can turn it around. WINE BARRON (2) is yet to fire in the NT but has the ability and can improve sharply. CRAZY BRAVE (6) was 12 lengths from FURY last time and can finish much closer.",
